## Memory — `_brain`

This repo keeps durable, non-derivable knowledge in `_brain/` (agent-agnostic, committed).

- **Before work:** read `_brain/INDEX.md`; open detail files whose hook matches the task.
- **Trust but verify:** a record reflects what was true when written — re-check any file,
  flag, command, or path it names before relying on it.
- **At close:** if you learned something the code can't reveal, add
  `_brain/learnings/<slug>.md` (schema in `_brain/_templates/learning.md`) and its
  `_brain/INDEX.md` pointer. Store only what is NOT derivable from code, git history, or docs.
